<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Di ph=E1=
=BB=8Fng v=E1=BA=A5n:</strong> Solid state management strategy! T=C3=B4i li=
ke vi=E1=BB=87c b=E1=BA=A1n separated concerns between different state type=
